      "writtenOn": "2016-04-14T14:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will shadow all users (ldap, custom drivers...).  Regarding sql users, shadow users first checks if the user exists in the user table; if not, maps them to the appropriate tables.  sql users will already be mapped, so will not be added; thus, not shadowed.",
